 "notes": "Answers: addresses 'street, city, ST ZIP' (Address 1 takes the street with any suite; State AZ is printed for the agent's boxes). agent_mailing: an Arizona mailing address, or 'Same as street address' to tick 4.2's box. principal_same: Yes or No; principal_address goes in 5.2 whenever it is answered, so leave it blank (or 'Same') when 5.1 is Yes (a US address also gets country USA; a foreign address goes whole on Address 1). signer: the printed name, written as given. Signature, date and the optional Attention lines are left blank; the date is stamped when the form is signed. Radio values are the PDF's /Opt export values (14/15, True/False, 11/10), which pdf-lib selects by; the dump shows the widgets' on-states 0/1. The XFA layer is dropped by the filler so the filled boxes show.",
 "boxes": {
  "entity_type": [
   {
